  "remaining": [
    "Repeated nominal bases are one component, not arbitrary compound or reduplication segmentation. Missing dictionary bases remain visible here and do not gain fabricated entries.",
    "Opaque roots, especially 천천히 and 분연히, further lexical classes, nominal -이, and derivation across suffix/auxiliary boundaries remain unreviewed.",
    "The shortened-word route is a documented lexical recovery, not a rule deleting arbitrary syllables or proving synchronic identity of every sense.",
    "Noun-derived adverbs keep adverb-compatible particle licenses; their source noun role does not make the derived adverb eligible for object/subject case marking."
  ],
